Evermore city
The first city of the game, it is a huge place with several maps
Accessed from safe zone, can be accessed from crystal train station as well
Contains different maps, the list being as follows
The fiery path, a small challenge. New players can practice their jumping technique on this map. After crossing it you get seven million dollars
Vehicle showroom. A place where you can buy different vehicles. Inside the showroom there is a place to test vehicles before buying
Test drive. A map on which you may test vehicles before buying. When you enter the vehicle showroom, enter the test drive map. You will be provided a vehicle pack in your inventory, which you can open and find all the vehicles of the game. Test them, and when you exit the map they will minus from your inventory. Please note, if you wish to test vehicles don’t buy any vehicles before going inside, otherwise they will be minused from your inventory.
Evermore mall, a huge shopping senter where you can buy different items from the different stores located inside
The mechanic's shop. Here you can repair your vehicles.
Coffee shop. A place where you can relax over a cup of coffee
Evermore delights. A small restaurant where you can eat.
Evermore bar. A place where you can buy different drinks
The burnt tower. Another challenge. On its completion you receive the tower pack, which contains a lot of items.
The beach. When you enter inside you may find a portal which can take you to the path to Fantasy Island
Path to Fantasy Island. A path built in the ocean that connects evermore city to the fantasy island. If you can successfully cross this path you can go to the fantasy island, even if your level is not 75. More information on Fantasy Island will be provided in the fantasy island's section.
The jungle. It is a place where new and inexperienced players can hunt and earn money by killing the different animals.
Evermore forest. A forest inside the jungle, in which small animals can be found.
The dangerous forest. Another forest inside the jungle, in which dangerous animals live. These animals give more money and items but are harder to kill.
The train station. When you enter here you can board the train after buying a ticket. From here you can travel to crystal city. More information on crystal city is provided in the section for crystal city.